rule purchase_values v1
description "What ringi writes from the form of purchase.ringi for the code it generates: the totals and computations over all the values what they read can take, and when a field is shown and asked for; the code holds each computation to its range"

elements lines
  quantity : number  range >=1 <=10_000
  price    : money[JPY]  range >=1JPY <=50_000_000JPY

define subtotal : money[JPY] = quantity * price

max subtotal_most over lines of subtotal  empty 1JPY

sum amount over lines of subtotal  range >=0JPY <=15_000_000_000_000JPY

outputs
  amount        : money[JPY]  round down(1JPY)
  subtotal_most : money[JPY]  round down(1JPY)
